      <title>Agora 0.1.0-nightly.20261110</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 23:57:05 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202611102353</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.0-nightly.20261110</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      
      <description><![CDATA[<p dir="auto">Built every night from <code class="notranslate">main</code> (<a class="commit-link" data-hovercard-type="commit" data-hovercard-url="https://github.com/WillyRL/agora/commit/2bde78ef637b4370053d20f38a0c77dfe11fbf64/hovercard" href="https://github.com/WillyRL/agora/commit/2bde78ef637b4370053d20f38a0c77dfe11fbf64"><tt>2bde78e</tt></a>). Newest features, rougher edges: for the tested version, use the <a href="https://github.com/WillyRL/agora/releases/latest">latest release</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Agora Nightly</strong> is a separate app: it installs next to Agora with its own settings and logins, and updates itself to each new nightly.</p>
<h2 dir="auto">Changes</h2>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Answer kanban cards; guide to setting up Hermes on another machine (<a class="commit-link" data-hovercard-type="commit" data-hovercard-url="https://github.com/WillyRL/agora/commit/2bde78ef637b4370053d20f38a0c77dfe11fbf64/hovercard" href="https://github.com/WillyRL/agora/commit/2bde78ef637b4370053d20f38a0c77dfe11fbf64"><tt>2bde78e</tt></a>)</li>
<li>CloudflareAccessTests: probe the plain address (CI's Foundation doubled the slash) (<a class="commit-link" data-hovercard-type="commit" data-hovercard-url="https://github.com/WillyRL/agora/commit/44742b8ba6c1ff446c982b55f15c60fbc8e4cead/hovercard" href="https://github.com/WillyRL/agora/commit/44742b8ba6c1ff446c982b55f15c60fbc8e4cead"><tt>44742b8</tt></a>)</li>
<li>Reach Hermes behind Cloudflare Access; paste screenshots (<a class="commit-link" data-hovercard-type="commit" data-hovercard-url="https://github.com/WillyRL/agora/commit/96a6aa53f5ebb471350d652bb6a392eba0a84e11/hovercard" href="https://github.com/WillyRL/agora/commit/96a6aa53f5ebb471350d652bb6a392eba0a84e11"><tt>96a6aa5</tt></a>)</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">This build isn't notarized: on first launch, open it once, then <strong>System Settings → Privacy &amp; Security → Open Anyway</strong> (or <code class="notranslate">xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine /Applications/Agora.app</code>).</p>]]></description>
